✍️ Fill in the Blanks

11. He is known for his ___.
a) honest
b) honesty
c) honestly
d) honor
✅ उत्तर: b) honesty


12. A ___ of birds flew away.
a) group
b) bunch
c) flock
d) team
✅ उत्तर: c) flock


13. The ___ of musicians performed on stage.
a) crew
b) troop
c) orchestra
d) class
✅ उत्तर: c) orchestra


14. ___ is a virtue.
a) Truthful
b) Truth
c) Truly
d) True
✅ उत्तर: b) Truth


15. He brought a bag full of ___.
a) rice
b) rices
c) a rice
d) the rice
✅ उत्तर: a) rice (Material noun – uncountable)




